    "Id": "mechdef_templar_TLR1-O_tancred",
    "Name": "Templar TLR1-O",
    "Details": "Configured for Tancred Sandoval, this configuration carries two rotary autocannon/5s that can fire at a rate six times as fast as a standard autocannon. These are backed up by three ER medium lasers for close combat. For long range engagements, the Tancred configuration has a single ER Large Laser. All of these weapons are linked to a Targeting Computer, giving them increased accuracy.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Templar"
  },
